        t: "For UK private sellers, eBay currently offers free selling in most categories within its monthly free-listing allowance, though optional upgrades and some other charges still apply. Business sellers have a separate fee structure. If you are buying stock specifically to resell as a business, eBay says you should register as a business seller.",
